00', 'title': "CENTENE CORPORATION'S 2022 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE AND INVESTOR DAY EVENT ON DECEMBER 10, 2021 WILL NOW BE HELD VIRTUALLY", 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS 2022 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE AND INVESTOR DAY EVENT, SCHEDULED FOR FRIDAY, DECEMBER 10, 2021, WILL NOW BE HELD ONLY IN A VIRTUAL FORMAT, OUT OF AN ABUNDANCE OF CAUTION OVER THE COVID-19 OMICRON VARIANT. THE COMPANY PREVIOUSLY PLANNED FOR A HYBRID EVENT, WITH LIMITED IN-PERSON ATTENDANCE.'}{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-12-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'CERIDIAN ACQUIRES ADAM HCM TO EXTEND GLOBAL LEADERSHIP', 'text': 'ACQUISITION TO ACCELERATE DELIVERY OF THE DAYFORCE PLATFORM IN MEXICO AND DRIVE VALUE TO MULTINATIONAL ORGANIZATIONS OPERATING IN LATIN AMERICA AND THE CARIBBEAN ACQUISITION TO ACCELERATE DELIVERY OF THE DAYFORCE PLATFORM IN MEXICO AND DRIVE VALUE TO MULTINATIONAL ORGANIZATIONS OPERATING IN LATIN AMERICA AND THE CARIBBEAN'}{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2021-12-06 08:05:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE AND THE FARMLINK PROJECT SEND REAL FOOD FROM FARMS TO FOOD BANKS THIS WINTER', 'text': 'NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF., DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS LATEST PARTNERSHIP WITH THE FARMLINK PROJECT\xa0TO FIGHT FOOD WASTE AND HUNGER.'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2021-12-06 16:30:00', 'title': 'CISCO TO HOST 2021 VIRTUAL ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF., DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CISCO\xa0(NASDAQ: CSCO) WILL HOST ITS 2021 VIRTUAL ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS ON\xa0MONDAY, DECEMBER 13, 2021, BEGINNING AT\xa08:00 A.M.'}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-12-06 17:23:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JANUARY 18, 2022 - CTXS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IS BEING ISSUED BY LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP: TO: ALL PER